# Exception: track only the R5 Capability Platform spec phase directory
# (requirements.md/design.md/tasks.md + any later OWNERSHIP.md/MIGRATION-PLAN.md/
# ARCHITECTURE-REVIEW.md/CLOSURE-NOTES.md living alongside them). All other
# .kiro content (other spec phases, frontend/docs/) remains ignored — each
# level below is re-ignored via a wildcard before the next level is opened,
# so only the one named path is ever un-ignored.
!frontend/.kiro/
frontend/.kiro/*
!frontend/.kiro/specs/
frontend/.kiro/specs/*
!frontend/.kiro/specs/R5-capability-platform/
!frontend/.kiro/specs/R5-capability-platform/**
